---
import ProjectDetail from "@/themes/fuyukawa-kagari/components/ProjectDetail.astro";
import { Icon } from "astro-icon/components";
---

<ProjectDetail
  title="Recon MCP"
  kicker="LOCAL-FIRST RECONNAISSANCE GATEWAY"
  description="基于 TypeScript、Node.js 与 MCP SDK 构建的统一网络资产侦察 Gateway，将本地扫描与可选 API provider 整理成一致的工具接口。"
  tags={["TypeScript", "MCP", "Asset Discovery"]}
>
  <section class="project-detail-section">
    <h2>三个统一入口</h2>
    <div class="project-detail-grid">
      <article class="project-detail-tile">
        <strong>asset_search</strong>
        <p>快速发现并汇总当前 target 的资产，优先使用本地能力。</p>
      </article>
      <article class="project-detail-tile">
        <strong>recon</strong>
        <p>串联子域发现、存活探测、端口检查与 nuclei 检查。</p>
      </article>
      <article class="project-detail-tile">
        <strong>deep_recon</strong>
        <p>在完整本地流程后按顺序尝试已启用的 API provider。</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="project-detail-section">
    <h2>执行链路</h2>
    <p>本地扫描按顺序运行；API provider 作为可选回退并串行执行。统一结果便于 Agent 和其他调用方消费。</p>
    <pre><code>AI Agent
  └─ recon-mcp
      ├─ local: subfinder → httpx → naabu → nuclei
      └─ API fallback: Netlas → Quake → FOFA</code></pre>
  </section>

  <section class="project-detail-section">
    <h2>调用示例</h2>
    <p>每次请求围绕调用方传入的 target，返回统一的资产列表、统计摘要、元数据与错误信息。</p>
    <pre><code>{JSON.stringify({ target: "example.com", deep: false }, null, 2)}</code></pre>
  </section>

  <section class="project-detail-section">
    <h2>运行方式</h2>
    <p>项目使用 Node.js 20 或更高版本；构建后以 stdio 模式启动，便于接入支持 MCP 的客户端。</p>
    <pre><code>npm install
npm run build
npm start</code></pre>
  </section>

  <a
    class="project-detail-section project-detail-repo-card"
    href="https://github.com/Felixz6/recon-mcp"
    target="_blank"
    rel="noopener noreferrer"
    aria-label="在 GitHub 上查看 Felixz6/recon-mcp 仓库"
  >
    <span class="project-detail-repo-mark" aria-hidden="true">
      <Icon name="simple-icons:github" />
    </span>
    <span class="project-detail-repo-copy">
      <span class="project-detail-repo-kicker">GITHUB REPOSITORY</span>
      <strong>Felixz6 / recon-mcp</strong>
      <span class="project-detail-repo-description">查看源代码、README 与项目更新。</span>
    </span>
    <Icon class="project-detail-repo-arrow" name="tabler:external-link" aria-hidden="true" />
  </a>
</ProjectDetail>
